# - Instagram profile 13theomaa_ (opened directly 2026-10-20): business account, name Theomaa, so the URL is verified for sameAs.
# - Shazam, Theomaa and 1T1 artist pages (opened 2026-10-20): Bouwey featuring Theomaa peaked at No. 48 on the Shazam Global Chart, 7 days in the Top 50, Top 50 debut 22 March 2025, around one million Shazams; Wa wa Waaaw among the most searched 1T1 and Theomaa records.
# - Shazam, New Bouyon Wave #1 song page (search index, 2026-10-20): D0 Production featuring Tiitii NBA, Nils, Dj Softee, Aknose and Theomaa, released 29 September 2023 by 2873529 Records DK, BPM 160.
# - CCN, Caraib Creole News, interview published 13 December 2025 (dossier verified for the 1T1 profile): in Guadeloupe the most emblematic bouyon artists of the moment are Lejuh, 1T1, Theomaa, Piscine OSP, Aknose and Shanika.
