# - Viberate, Theomaa artist page (search index, 2026-10-20): top tracks Bouwey, Leave Me Alone, Wa wa Waaaw, Ouba and Baddest; Baddest (2025) with Matieu White and 1T1; Il pleut (2024); largest audience share in France. Used with attribution only, as a secondary aggregator.
# - Kribbean and Caribbean Music Awards coverage (opened 2026-10-20): fourth Caribbean Music Awards, 19 September at the National Academy for the Performing Arts, Port of Spain, Trinidad and Tobago; Theomaa announced in the first wave of performers and nominated for Bouyon Song of the Year; winners list: Bouyon Song of the Year, Bouwey, 1T1 and Theomaa; French Caribbean Song of the Year, Ouba, 1T1 and Theomaa; Dominica spotlighted as the birthplace of bouyon, with the Government of Dominica as category sponsor and Billboard as global media partner.
# Note: a gold certification and a Nigeria number one for Bouwey circulate on social media, but no SNEP listing confirming them was found in the sources opened for this profile or for the 1T1 profile, so neither is presented as verified. No full name, birth date or solo project for Theomaa was published in the verified sources, so none is printed here. This dossier is thinner than most on this site and the profile says so openly.

